    "Private keys live in Apple's Keychain and are never sent to a server. iCloud sync is off until you turn it on, and even then only keys you choose go to iCloud Keychain.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "私钥存放在 Apple 的 Keychain 中，从不发送到服务器。iCloud 同步在您开启之前处于关闭状态；即使开启，也只有您选择的密钥才会进入 iCloud Keychain。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "私密金鑰存放在 Apple 的 Keychain 中，絕不會傳送至伺服器。iCloud 同步在您開啟之前處於關閉狀態；即使開啟，也只有您選擇的金鑰才會進入 iCloud Keychain。"
          }
        }
      }
