            "state": "translated",
            "value": "終端機"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Terminal for %@": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%@ 的终端"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%@ 的終端機"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Terms of Use": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "使用条款"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "使用條款"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Text copied from the terminal is removed from the clipboard by iOS after this long. Public keys copied from the key list stay until replaced.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "从终端复制的文本会在这段时间后由 iOS 从剪贴板移除。从密钥列表复制的公钥会一直保留，直到被替换。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "從終端機複製的文字會在這段時間後由 iOS 從剪貼簿移除。從金鑰清單複製的公開金鑰會一直保留，直到被取代。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "That file could not be read as text.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "无法以文本形式读取该文件。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "無法以文字形式讀取該檔案。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The app cannot tell a real server from an impostor on a first connection. Compare the fingerprint it shows with what the server reports. A changed key is always refused until you decide.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "首次连接时，本应用无法分辨真实服务器与冒充者。请将显示的 fingerprint 与服务器自身报告的进行比对。已更改的密钥总是会被拒绝，直到您作出决定。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "首次連線時，本應用程式無法分辨真實伺服器與冒充者。請將顯示的 fingerprint 與伺服器自身回報的內容比對。已變更的金鑰一律會被拒絕，直到您做出決定。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The command is typed into the terminal and waits for you to press Return.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "命令会被输入到终端中，等待你按下 Return 键。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "指令會輸入到終端機中，等待你按下 Return 鍵。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The connection could not be established.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "无法建立连接。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "無法建立連線。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The connection to the host was lost.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "与主机的连接已断开。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "與主機的連線已中斷。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The document %@ is not included in this build.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "此版本未包含文档 %@。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "此版本未包含文件 %@。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The host key has changed": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "host key 已变更"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "host key 已變更"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The key can only be used after a successful biometric or passcode check, and becomes unusable if the device's biometric enrolment changes.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "此密钥只有在生物识别或设备密码验证通过后才能使用；如果设备上录入的生物识别信息发生变化，此密钥将无法再使用。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "此金鑰只有在生物辨識或裝置密碼驗證通過後才能使用；若裝置上註冊的生物辨識資料變更，此金鑰將無法再使用。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The private key is removed from this device and any connection using it will stop working. This cannot be undone.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "私钥将从本设备移除，所有使用它的连接都将无法继续工作。此操作无法撤销。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "私密金鑰將從本裝置移除，所有使用它的連線都將無法繼續運作。此操作無法復原。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The remote program supports bracketed paste, so the text will be inserted without running it. Check it before pressing Return.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "远端程序支持 bracketed paste，因此文本只会被插入，不会直接运行。按 Return 键前请先核对内容。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "遠端程式支援 bracketed paste，因此文字只會被插入，不會直接執行。按 Return 鍵前請先核對內容。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The shell exited.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "shell 已退出。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "shell 已結束。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "There is no account, no server, no analytics and no crash reporter. Traffic goes only to the servers you connect to and, for tunnelled hosts, to Cloudflare on your behalf.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "没有账户、没有服务器、没有分析，也没有崩溃报告器。流量只会发往您所连接的服务器，以及（对于经隧道连接的主机）代表您发往 Cloudflare。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "沒有帳號、沒有伺服器、沒有分析，也沒有當機回報器。流量只會傳送至您所連線的伺服器，以及（對於經隧道連線的主機）代表您傳送至 Cloudflare。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This connection is set to use a Cloudflare Access service token, but none is stored on this device.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "此连接设置为使用 Cloudflare Access 服务令牌，但本设备上未存储任何令牌。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "此連線設定為使用 Cloudflare Access 服務權杖，但本裝置上未儲存任何權杖。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This key is encrypted. The passphrase is used once to unlock it and is not stored.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
